{"id":"the-world-is-still-beautiful","v":1,"lines":[{"t0":0.5,"t1":4.58,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"There's a cat on the windowsill,","fb":1},{"t0":4.58,"t1":9.06,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"There's a bicycle rolling down the hill.","w":[[4.58,5.3],[5.3,5.48],[5.48,6.2],[6.2,7.64],[7.64,8.32],[8.32,8.86],[8.86,9.11]]},{"t0":9.06,"t1":12.42,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Someone's laughing across the street,","w":[[9.06,10],[10,10.28],[10.28,11.26],[11.26,11.84],[11.84,12.4]]},{"t0":12.42,"t1":18.24,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Someone's dancing to a broken beat.","w":[[12.42,14.4],[14.4,14.92],[14.92,15.4],[15.4,15.7],[15.7,16.12],[16.12,17.04]]},{"t0":19.06,"t1":23.56,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The baker's opening up the door,","w":[[19.06,19.42],[19.42,20.14],[20.14,20.7],[20.7,21.44],[21.44,21.8],[21.8,22.36]]},{"t0":23.64,"t1":27,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"A little rain on the corner store.","w":[[23.64,23.88],[23.88,24.28],[24.28,24.86],[24.86,25.26],[25.26,25.48],[25.48,25.88],[25.88,26.62]]},{"t0":27,"t1":30.32,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Nothing special, nothing new,","w":[[27,27.16],[27.16,28.92],[28.92,29.5],[29.5,30.24]]},{"t0":30.32,"t1":34.67,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"But somehow everything feels true.","w":[[30.32,30.88],[30.88,31.52],[31.52,32.98],[32.98,33.78],[33.78,34.65]]},{"t0":34.67,"t1":38.1,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Oh, the world is still beautiful,","w":[[34.67,34.94],[34.94,36.16],[36.16,36.58],[36.58,37.02],[37.02,37.3],[37.3,38.08]]},{"t0":38.1,"t1":42.64,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Even when the sky turns gray.","w":[[38.1,39.04],[39.04,39.42],[39.42,39.64],[39.64,40.04],[40.04,40.66],[40.66,41.44]]},{"t0":44.06,"t1":47.18,"sec":"Chorus","text":"There's a thousand little miracles","w":[[44.06,44.52],[44.52,44.74],[44.74,45.62],[45.62,46.16],[46.16,46.74]]},{"t0":47.18,"t1":51.26,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Hiding in an ordinary day.","w":[[47.18,47.84],[47.84,48.26],[48.26,48.52],[48.52,49.02],[49.02,50.06]]},{"t0":52.44,"t1":56.76,"sec":"Chorus","text":"So open up the window, let the sunlight in,","w":[[52.44,52.82],[52.82,53.36],[53.36,53.7],[53.7,53.96],[53.96,54.51],[54.51,54.82],[54.82,55.1],[55.1,55.52],[55.52,56.18]]},{"t0":56.76,"t1":60.7,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Let the smallest things remind you again:","w":[[56.76,56.88],[56.88,57.08],[57.08,57.54],[57.54,58],[58,58.4],[58.4,59.94],[59.94,60.68]]},{"t0":60.7,"t1":65.18,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Oh, the world is still beautiful,","w":[[60.7,61.74],[61.74,62.36],[62.36,62.8],[62.8,63.16],[63.16,63.56],[63.56,64.36]]},{"t0":65.18,"t1":68.54,"sec":"Chorus","text":"And we're here to see it spin.","w":[[65.18,65.38],[65.38,65.7],[65.7,65.98],[65.98,66.36],[66.36,66.71],[66.71,66.98],[66.98,67.34]]},{"t0":71.46,"t1":75.72,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Let's take the train to somewhere new,","w":[[71.46,72],[72,72.18],[72.18,72.4],[72.4,72.92],[72.92,73.48],[73.48,74.06],[74.06,75.2]]},{"t0":75.72,"t1":79.4,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Buy cheap flowers in a different town.","w":[[75.72,76.08],[76.08,76.62],[76.62,77.28],[77.28,77.76],[77.76,77.92],[77.92,78.42],[78.42,79.38]]},{"t0":79.4,"t1":83.48,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Eat our lunch beside the sea,","w":[[79.4,80.98],[80.98,81.24],[81.24,81.66],[81.66,82.62],[82.62,83.06],[83.06,83.46]]},{"t0":83.48,"t1":88.38,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Make up stories about people we see.","w":[[83.48,83.94],[83.94,84.22],[84.22,85.5],[85.5,86.36],[86.36,87.1],[87.1,87.74],[87.74,88.36]]},{"t0":88.38,"t1":92.36,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"We don't need a perfect plan,","w":[[88.38,89.74],[89.74,90.06],[90.06,90.56],[90.56,91],[91,91.58],[91.58,92.34]]},{"t0":92.36,"t1":97.44,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Just a little time and a place to land.","w":[[92.36,93.34],[93.34,93.8],[93.8,94.2],[94.2,94.8],[94.8,95.2],[95.2,95.38],[95.38,95.72],[95.72,95.99],[95.99,96.69]]},{"t0":97.44,"t1":100.92,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"There's so much waiting down the street,","w":[[97.44,98.16],[98.16,98.38],[98.38,98.72],[98.72,99.14],[99.14,100.18],[100.18,100.56],[100.56,100.9]]},{"t0":100.92,"t1":